      "text": "Pins used\n  1   probe 1              2   probe 2\n  11  fan 1 speed control   13  fan 1 speed signal\n  12  fan 2 speed control   14  fan 2 speed signal\n  21  on/off switch         3V3 / GND  → rails\n\nOn the board (orange):\n  button 0 — single: Normal ↔ Quiet · double: Max · long: Normal\n  LED 47  — green Normal · blue Quiet · red Max · amber switch off",
      "originalText": "Pins used\n  1   probe 1              2   probe 2\n  11  fan 1 speed control   13  fan 1 speed signal\n  12  fan 2 speed control   14  fan 2 speed signal\n  21  on/off switch         3V3 / GND  → rails\n\nOn the board (orange):\n  button 0 — single: Normal ↔ Quiet · double: Max · long: Normal\n  LED 47  — green Normal · blue Quiet · red Max · amber switch off",
